The '''Triple Dark Blade''' is a {{Mythical}} admin-exclusive [[sword]].

The Triple Dark Blade resembles the [[Triple Katana]], except instead of katanas, three [[Dark Blade|Dark Blades]] are wielded. It has the same skills as the original Dark Blade, though with slight modifications.

==Obtainment==
The Triple Dark Blade is not obtainable for normal players, as it is exclusive to ''Blox Fruits''<nowiki>'s</nowiki> staff and content creators in the [[Blox Fruits Star Program]]. Ways to obtain the Triple Dark Blade include:
* Winning events hosted by admins, such as tournaments, could sometimes award the winner with the Triple Dark Blade. However, such events are no longer hosted regularly.
* Many helpers of the ''Blox Fruits'' Discord server have the Triple Dark Blade, as well as testers.
* All admins have the Triple Dark Blade.
* All content creators in the ''[[Blox Fruits Star Program]]'' have the Triple Dark Blade.

<blockquote>"Don't beg admins for this sword. They won't give you it." -tort.</blockquote>

